      "v": 9,
      "zh": "底波拉说：「我必与你同去，只是你在所行的路上得不着荣耀，因为耶和华要将西西拉交在一个妇人手里。」于是底波拉起来，与巴拉一同往基低斯去了。",
      "en": "She said, “I will indeed go with you. But you will not gain fame[NOTE:1] on the expedition you are undertaking,[NOTE:2] for the Lord will turn Sisera over to a woman.”[NOTE:3] Deborah got up and went with Barak to Kedesh.",
